  "releaseNotes": "'## [15.0.0-prerelease.4](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v15.0.0-prerelease.3...v15.0.0-prerelease.4) (2026-11-25)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* See the [migration guide](https://dotnet.github.io/dotnet-operator-sdk/docs/operator/migration#upgrading-from-v14-to-v15) for upgrading from v14 to v15.\n* **client:** remove force from the JSON patch overloads (#1353)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **client:** remove force from the JSON patch overloads ([#1353](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1353)) ([c90a76a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c90a76a714dd23d230302d2b9de06f764f8d3f45)), closes [#1047](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1047) [#1350](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1350) [1348/#1351](https://github.com/1348/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1351)\n'",
